  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br>🎨 СТАРЫЙ <span style=\"color:#3598db\">ЛОГОТИП</span> 🎨<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_46e95108-b781-4993-8896-e03df503b1bd.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"><br><br></span></strong></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">⚠️ ВНИМАНИЕ!</span><br>Я переписываю свой мод в IntelliJ, так как не люблю MCreator. Будьте осторожны с предметами при обновлении до версии 3.0&nbsp;<br><br><br></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NbJmpNSsDs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_16b257e2-fd12-4e1d-9a98-1966ac2e433a.png\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PolyAgnesTaychonBF/posts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_86b25ee1-b73a-4708-b1a5-e9c49bf9e9f5.png\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></span></strong></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\">ДОБАВЛЕНО</span>&nbsp;<br><br>🔨 <span style=\"color:#3598db\">МОЛОТ</span> 🔨<br></span>Молоты добывают область 3x3</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MPecVxF.gif\" alt=\"hammers-habillity-hammer-3x3\" width=\"374\" height=\"210\"></span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">⚒️ <span style=\"color:#3598db\">ЭКСКАВАТОР</span> ⚒️<br></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Экскаватор добывает область 3x3</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9fczuhG.gif\" width=\"375\" height=\"211\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br>🪓 <span style=\"color:#3598db\">БОЕВОЙ ТОПОР</span> 🪓<br></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Боевой топор рубит деревья без листвы</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xTcbdG9.gif\" width=\"379\" height=\"213\"><br></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_932b0e00-48c8-469a-bd0b-806095086c54.png\"> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">СОВМЕСТИМО</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\">РУДЫ</span> </span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_932b0e00-48c8-469a-bd0b-806095086c54.png\"></span></span><br></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&bull; Незерит <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_fc98f57b-b9c0-4a36-80c8-ec3f813aeb55.png\"></strong><br><strong>&bull; Алмаз <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_932b0e00-48c8-469a-bd0b-806095086c54.png\"></strong><br><strong>&bull; Золото <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_20c14490-eea4-49da-bc73-a01d0c329ddc.png\"></strong><br><strong>&bull; Железо <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_20c86dee-73e2-408f-b027-2821f6e2ba9d.png\"></strong><br><strong>&bull; Дерево <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_9534d014-f201-42dc-aeaf-cb4dee6af8ef.png\"></strong><br><strong>&bull; Камень <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_6071db9b-4f39-4afe-88f0-53351fb8ade9.png\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>🖼️ <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">РЕСУРСЫ</span> </span>🖼️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Старый логотип<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">:</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/300/727/64/64/637359156124613439.png\" alt=\"Practical Tools logo\" width=\"222\" height=\"222\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>✋ <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">ПРЕДМЕТЫ</span> </span>✋</strong></span><br><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_781adc27-d075-4abe-b07b-04efb9a9c6e8.png\" width=\"486\" height=\"308\"></strong></h4>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">📚&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">ВСЕ МОЛОТЫ СОВМЕСТИМЫ С ЗАЧАРОВАНИЯМИ</span> </span></span>📚</span></strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull; Шёлковое касание</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull; Удача I, II и III</span></span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚠️ УДАЛЁН МОЛОТ ИЗ СТЕКЛА ⚠️</span></strong><br><strong>&bull; Причина в том, что я делаю ремейк Extended Diamonds.<br><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✌️ <span style=\"color:#3598db\">СКОРО ВЫХОД МОДОВ И СКОРО СОВМЕСТИМОСТЬ</span> 🤝<br></span></strong><strong>&bull; Valord Ores (СКОРО ВЫХОД МОДА)</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">РЕКОМЕНДУЕМЫЕ МОДЫ</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;</strong><em><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/model-gap-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Model Gap Fix</a></em><br></span></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull; </span></span></strong></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Configured</em></a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>&bull; </strong></span></span></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br>✌️ <span style=\"color:#3598db\">СКОРО СОВМЕСТИМОСТЬ</span> 🤝</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&bull; Poly Ores PolyPorted: Совместимость<br>&bull; Aether Mod: Совместимость</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><br></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">🤝 <span style=\"color:#3598db\">СОВМЕСТИМОСТЬ</span> </span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">🤝<br></span></span><br><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&bull; Advanced Netherite</a><br><br>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_1f063f32-6601-4539-85b0-a290ec39b6eb.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"184\"></em><br></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\" height=\"13\"></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">КРЕДИТЫ:</span></strong></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Оригинальный создатель мода:</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/neurodr0me\" rel=\"nofollow\">neurodr0me</a><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Оригинальный мод</span><br></span></strong></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/practical-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Practical Tools</a><br></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324263/description_2dbd85a9-1723-4098-a77d-5e26598d0f40.png\" width=\"780\